{'question': 'Question Text: \begin{tabular}{|c|c|} \hline Test score & Frequency \( (f) \) \\ \hline \( 0-4 \) & \( 4 \) \\ \hline \( 5-9 \) & \( 6 \) \\ \hline \( 10-14 \) & \( 13 \) \\ \hline \( 15-19 \) & \( 17 \) \\ \hline \( 20-24 \) & \( 10 \) \\ \hline \end{tabular}
Question Text: In which class interval will the median be found?
Answer A Text: \( 15-19 \)
Answer B Text: \( 25 \)
